# Normalise to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# tests/golden/jake_resume.tex is compared byte for byte against a fresh Jinja
# render, and Jinja emits LF. Without this, Git's autocrlf would check the
# golden file out with CRLF on Windows and the snapshot test would fail on a
# clean clone for reasons that have nothing to do with the template.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.pdf binary
*.png binary
